{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"没在想\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-1\",\n      \"text\": \"催逼停下来后，他发现自己舍不得的不是一时舒服，而是曾真心相信过的生活。\",\n      \"key\": \"催逼停下来\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他盼着和人亲近时不必时时防备，也盼着珍惜的东西不用靠争抢才能留住。\",\n      \"key\": \"不必时时防备\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他想付出时只是因为喜欢，不必反复证明自己值得被爱、被接纳，也不必先想着靠近会受伤。\",\n      \"key\": \"只是因为喜欢\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他确实尝过那种亲近带来的快乐，不愿只因眼下做不到，就把这份向往说成软弱。\",\n      \"key\": \"亲近带来的快乐\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他暂时不再担心心里一软就会停步，才肯承认自己也有委屈和思念。\",\n      \"key\": \"一软就会停步\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-8\",\n      \"text\": \"他允许自己去爱、去相信，先珍惜心里向往的生活，不急着求它实现或证明有用，也不拿责任和它比轻重。\",\n      \"key\": \"去爱、去相信\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B5\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-6\",\n      \"text\": \"他终于能安心地想那种生活，心里满足、柔软起来，也更盼着有一天能过上那样的日子，先前的疲惫暂时淡了。\",\n      \"key\": \"满足、柔软\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-7\",\n      \"text\": \"这份安宁让他一时不愿把心思拉回眼前的难处，可他盼着的生活还没有真正来到。\",\n      \"key\": \"盼着的生活\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B3\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S06-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S06-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S03-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S06-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S06-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S06-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R27\", \"R28\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S06-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并\",\n      \"why\": \"保留亲近曾带来的真实快乐，以及这段经历为何使他不愿否定自己的向往；删去重复的经历事实和替他作出的评价。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [],\n      \"now\": [\"S06-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"去掉向谁解释难过的现实处境，改为写他暂时不再担心柔软会使自己停步，因此肯承认委屈和思念。S05-4为这一变化提供理由。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R29\", \"R30\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S06-8\", \"S06-6\"],\n      \"what\": \"拆分并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"明确保留主动允许自己去爱、去相信，以及不急着审查能否实现、有没有用和与责任孰轻孰重；把满足与柔软写成随后的结果。用珍惜心里的向往保留B5的爱惜态度，不再把比喻写成恢复过去的现实目标。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R31\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S06-7\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把舍不得离开的空间表达改成不愿把心思拉回眼前难处，保留暂时沉浸于安宁、但向往的生活尚未实现这两个同时成立的事实。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R25\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S06-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"调整箭头\",\n      \"why\": \"删除S02-3到S06-2的箭头，改由S03-2指回。S03-2已经明确写出不必防备的生活愿望，S02-3只说明珍惜的东西不再能自然拥有，不能推出争抢。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R29\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S06-8\"],\n      \"what\": \"删除箭头\",\n      \"why\": \"删除S01-1到S06-8的箭头。过去回不来不能解释他此刻为何允许自己爱惜与相信，这一心理变化由本段已经承认的向往及真实快乐承接。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "25cb9015-6a0a-4e54-986a-6ecbfe2078cc", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T002750043376Z", "elapsed_seconds": 161.172, "completed_utc": "2026-10-30T00:30:31.210882+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c0e8d4159f4066d7835e49915a7ee1e9a0acb024aa7a8700b3714271a0d9f87f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T002750043376Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "0734ddd41504c9141bdcbb29672dfafd3d5e7591e621fee2db951f35a223c927"}}}
